    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<table style=\"width:100%; margin-top:2em; border:2px solid #999; font-size:105%; text-align:center; background:#00008B;\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <td><i><b>This <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Homebrew_Content\" title=\"Homebrew Content\">Homebrew Content</a> has been <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Tested\" title=\"Category:Tested\">Tested</a> per the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Untested\" title=\"Category:Untested\">Untested</a> guidelines. Whether or not it can be used is, as always, the prerogative of the Gamemaster.</b></i> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><p><i>Homebrew Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dathomir_Field_Guide\" title=\"Dathomir Field Guide\">Dathomir Field Guide</a></i> </p><p>Energy Bows are energy weapons crafted and used by <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Witches_of_Dathomir\" title=\"The Witches of Dathomir\">The Witches of Dathomir</a>. The bowstrings and arrows of the weapon were made of pure plasma, and emit a bright pink or purple glow. A solid grip In the middle of the bowstring allows the weapon to be held without harming the user. </p><p>An Energy Bow possesses the same <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Range\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Range\">Range</a> categories as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Pistol\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Pistol\">Pistol</a>. Due to its simple construction, Energy Bows do not have any <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Upgrade_Slots\" title=\"Upgrade Slots\">Upgrade Slots</a>. Members of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Witches_of_Dathomir\" title=\"The Witches of Dathomir\">The Witches of Dathomir</a> treat the Energy Bow as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Simple_Weapon_(Ranged)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Simple Weapon (Ranged)\">Simple Weapon (Ranged)</a>. </p><p>Like a standard <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bow\" title=\"Bow\">Bow</a>, the wielder's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a>&nbsp;modifier applies to damage dealt with an Energy Bow. An Energy Bow may only hold a single plasma arrow at a time, but a new plasma arrow can be reloaded as a&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Free_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Free Action\">Free Action</a>. An Energy Bow generates its plasma from an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Energy_Cell\" title=\"Energy Cell\">Energy Cell</a>. After 20 bolts of plasma, the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Energy_Cell\" title=\"Energy Cell\">Energy Cell</a> must be replaced. </p><p><b>Accurate:</b> This weapon takes no penalty when firing at targets at Short <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Range\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Range\">Range</a>. </p>",
